{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Bru &amp; Boegie: Episode 1 - Get da MILK!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A hand-drawn 2D surrealist comedy point-and-click adventure game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As <strong>featured</strong> on <i>itch.io</i> with an <strong>average rating of 4.8/5</strong> \u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;I have never played a game this funny...&quot; -\u00a0<i>Krizezivota</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;BRILLIANT. Loved every single thing about it.&quot; -\u00a0<i>latetothegames</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cAbsolute masterpiece.\u201d - \u2665 \ud835\udc68\ud835\udc8d\ud835\udc86\ud835\udc8f\ud835\udc86 \u2665</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;i just finished the game, i just love it, i think this is my new favorite game, or one of them...&quot; - <i>dunkkke</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Amazing and unhinged game, I loved it \ud83e\udd23\u201d -\u00a0<i>hyprZona</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cI LOVE THIS\u201d - <i>Jaelix</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You are Bru.</strong><br>You need milk for your coffee. <br>YOH. The stakes are hectic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/1_overview.png?t=1748890166\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slip into the underpants of\u00a0<strong>Bru</strong>, a strange stoic man-child on a mission:\u00a0<strong>get milk for da coffee.</strong>\u00a0<strong>Point and click</strong> your way through a <strong>fully hand-drawn and animated world</strong>, featuring a <strong>fully-voiced cast</strong> and an <strong>original soundtrack</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by classic point-and-click adventures like\u00a0<i>Sam &amp; Max: Hit the Road</i>\u00a0and\u00a0<i>Day of the Tentacle</i>, this puzzle adventure serves up a healthy dose of ridiculousness that you can complete in a single sitting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the\u00a0<strong>first episode</strong>\u00a0in  a <strong>trilogy</strong> of\u00a0<i>Bru &amp; Boegie</i>\u00a0games.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/2_features.png?t=1748890166\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>One-Button Gameplay:</strong>\u00a0So intuitive, even an Ouma can master it!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Interactions deluxe:</strong>\u00a0More unique interactions than\u00a0you can shake a stick at.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rarefied Humour:</strong>\u00a0Enjoy bizarre characters, non sequiturs and irreverent small-batch bespoke conspiracy theories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Original Hand-Drawn Art &amp; Animation:</strong>\u00a0Made by human hands - nice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fully-Human Voiced Cast:</strong>\u00a0Almost <strong>1,000\u00a0dialogue entries</strong>, all fully-voiced by real people.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Original Music Score:</strong>\u00a0Catchy tunes to make you feel <strong>kiff</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mini-Games!</strong>\u00a0Stop the intrusive thoughts from infiltrating your mind in 'Meditation HERO', and collect all 15 stickers scattered around the world\u00a0to unlock a surprise!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You Can\u2019t Die:</strong>\u00a0Low stress, plenty lols!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/extras/9_extras.png?t=1748890166\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Demo </strong>planned.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Steam Achievements</strong> planned.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple languages</strong> planned.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam version to include <strong>new and improved audio</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready for <strong>EPISODE 2</strong>\u00a0'Coming Soon' Steam page!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3711090?t=1748890166","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/6f9e1ebc36f47a4c964e5d6299959f8978ffa7df/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748890166","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/94f0948a28eba23114bd5645f3a1fee36c456c04/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748890166","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711090/94f0948a28eba23114bd5645f3a1fee36c456c04/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748890166","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Bru &amp; Boegie: Episode 1 - Get da MILK!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A hand-drawn 2D surrealist comedy point-and-click adventure game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As <strong>featured</strong> on <i>itch.io</i> with an <strong>average rating of 4.8/5</strong> \u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f\u2b50\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;I have never played a game this funny...&quot;